++ Weapon Upgrading
 - Add 10 upgrade slots to each weapon
 - If weapon is 10/10, player has option to upgrade to the next rarity, resetting upgrades back to 0. This would add a bunch of alpha mods to the weapon
 - Each upgrade has a % chance to fail, losing 1 upgrade slot on the weapon and reverting up to 1 upgrade
    5/10 -> fail -> 4/9 or 5/9
 - The higher the rarity & the number of upgrades, the lower the rate of success
    [Common] 5 => 6 [90% Success]
    [Uncommon] 5 => 6 [84% Success]
    [Rare] 5 => 6 [70% Success]
    [Legendary] 5 => 6 [50% Success]
    [Mythic] 5 => 6 [20% Success]

Let you level up a weapon's proficiency by use (maybe 25% rate of normal xp gain)
